      strengths: ['Prevents the run-ending death that cannot be undone', 'Station can be kept up almost permanently', 'Large improvement over the first game\'s Doc'],
      weaknesses: ['Contributes little damage', 'Value drops sharply in solo play', 'Requires the team to actually use the station'],
      sources: [{ vid: 'R0dHm6IrCRo', marks: [[29,'Advanced Trauma Station'],[56,'Metabolic Stimulant and Defibrillation'],[87,'Overheal'],[142,'Pressurized Dispersion and Passive Charging 2'],[201,'Mechanic and Concentrated Stims']] },
                { vid: '4liVTFRmSBI', marks: [[283,'Why the Medic matters more now'],[309,'No revives at launch']] }],
